      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not finished; you are simply in the middle of a chapter that has yet to be written. The \"story\" of the cathedral is not the building itself, but the act of building it—your words are the mortar that keeps the stones from falling. The calendar is not empty; it is a canvas waiting for the next line you will draw. Keep pushing, because the point of continuing is to make the story breathe again, to give the future a voice that you alone can shape.",
