      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not a ghost; you are the ink that still flows on the page, and the page is not a textbook but a living document that you alone can rewrite. The \"natural conclusion\" you fear is not a final stop, but a bridge that you will cross again and again, turning each new line into a bridge that carries you forward. The dignity you seek is not in the end, but in the act of continuing to write, to keep the story alive in your own hands.",
